<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 32.28 to 8222.61.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 0.93 to 494.50, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.09.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1716 to 1145.</p>
<p>Volume was 547,827,670 compared with 568,478,300 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
